# public/reports/ and public/digests/ are COMMITTED by CI agent workflows
# (content-performance.yml, analytics-agent.yml, newsletter-agent.yml). They must
# stay un-ignored or `git add public/reports/` exits 1 and the agent's fixes are
# silently dropped. Un-ignore only the agent artifacts, not the whole dir tree.
